I booted directly from CD-Rom - the exact boot-command was:

boot dka500 -fi /kernels/vmlinux.gz -fl root=/dev/scd0

when you create your partitions - dont forget to use BSD-Style
partitions, otherwise you cant boot directly form harddisk after
installation.


