Vic,

I also have a 433a, as well as a 433au.  The Adaptec controller is not
supported by SRM thus can not be used for boot, you must use the AlphaBIOS.
The Qlogic controllers are supported by SRM, thus you can boot to them.
From what I understand, you can install Linux using the SRM, and boot from a
floppy.  You also may need to upgrade your video card, a Matrox Millennium
II is a good and inexpensive bet.

Regards,

Stephen
